    pr_ref:  # 2df1
    description: "FOUND 2026-09-26 during INV-bamij's ruby batch, and reproduced INSIDE a method, so it predates and is independent of that change:\n\n    class HealthServer; def root; 1; end; end\n    class App\n      def boot\n        Rails.root.join(\"lib\")   # -> calls ruby:m.rb:2-4:HealthServer#root:method  (ast_call, receiver=generic)\n      end\n    end\n\nA call on an EXTERNAL constant receiver (`Rails`, `Postal::Config` when the method is not defined on it) binds to any in-repo method of the same short name. On postal (INV-bamij read-back) `Rails.root.join(...)` bound HealthServer#root and `Postal::Config.dns` bound DNSResolver#dns. The receiver named a type the repository does not declare; a short-name match on a DIFFERENT class is the receiver-blind binding INV-maluk / INV-fahub forbid in other analyzers.\n\nFIX SHAPE (not built): when the receiver is a constant that names no repository class/module (or names one that does not declare the method), emit the unresolved edge with the constant as module slot instead of resolving by short name. Frequency NOT measured."  # 2df1
    fields: {}  # 2df1
